OL,3,GNEWSAAbnormal loads to cause
OL,4,A'significant' delays on M5
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists have been warned to expect
OL,7,F"significant" delays on the M5 as three
OL,8,Flarge silos are transported more than
OL,9,F80 miles (128 km) along the motorway.
OL,11,FThe 25-tonne cylinder will leave
OL,12,FAvonmouth in Bristol at 18:00 BST on
OL,13,FWednesday, with a further two silos to
OL,14,Fbe moved on separate days in October.
OL,16,FDue to their height and weight, each
OL,17,Fsilo will take two days to travel
OL,18,Fbetween Junction 18 (Avonmouth) and
OL,19,FJunction 2 (Oldbury Interchange) in the
OL,20,FWest Midlands.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
