OL,3,GNEWSAAbnormal loads to cause
OL,4,A'significant' delays on M5
OL,5,
OL,6,FA National Highways spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"We expect significant delays,
OL,8,Festimated between 60 and 90 minutes.
OL,9,FThe vehicles are scheduled to pull over
OL,10,Fat appropriate locations to allow the
OL,11,Fbuild-up of traffic to pass."
